      "content": "In this situation, I would recommend minimizing the involvement of CSAT and chargebacks by responding to the customer via email or phone, and investigating further into the damage. You can ask the customer to provide photos of the vase and estimated damage time, which can help determine the cause of the breakage. This approach can help resolve the issue without escalating the situation and resolving the dispute with the customer.",
